{"id": "EUVD-2024-55783", "enisaUuid": "9f78481b-8504-3e0e-81c0-a8dba1433b96", "description": "HoloViz Panel from 1.2.2 before 1.9.0 contains an open redirect vulnerability in panel/auth.py that allows remote attackers to redirect users by supplying an unvalidated next query parameter. BasicLoginHandler and PasswordLoginHandler store the parameter in a next_url cookie, so crafted login links send victims to attacker-controlled external sites after successful login.", "datePublished": "2026-10-12T20:55:07", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-13T17:39:31", "baseScore": 5.1, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:A/VC:N/VI:N/VA:N/SC:L/SI:L/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/holoviz/panel/issues/6782", "https://github.com/holoviz/panel/commit/a6a8b2cb9592a014cf6a7b0d3d5fc9cbf59bb2ed", "https://github.com/holoviz/panel/blob/v1.8.10/panel/auth.py#L866-L900", "https://github.com/holoviz/panel", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/holoviz-panel-from-1.2.2-before-1.9.0-open-redirect-via-next-parameter"], "aliases": ["CVE-2024-58389", "GHSA-hjgr-c5c2-5h55"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.28, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "8f5b81ec-b91c-3561-9e49-46610a4e2392", "product": {"name": "panel", "vendor": {"name": "ConvoyPanel"}}, "product_version": "1.2.2 <1.9.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "0816d10c-7c96-3a76-9a16-e24c2fc12618", "vendor": {"name": "HoloViz"}}], "isExploited": false}